  "title": "Cabbage and Broccoli Slaw with Vinegar Dressing",
  "description": "This cabbage and broccoli slaw with vinegar dressing recipe includes a zesty dressing, broccoli, cabbage, tomatoes, scallions, almonds, and cranberries.",
